# The startup graphics chooser (CLAUDE.md "Startup graphics chooser"). Run with the chooser scripted to
# Planetarium and its frames captured:
#   python tools/harness/run.py tools/harness/scripts/boot_chooser.satcmd --boot-chooser 1 --boot-capture
# captures/boot_NN.png are the chooser (default, then option 1) and the loading screen after it.
# Checks: the pick is applied, the full sky pipelines are deferred on the light tier, and a switch to a
# full preset builds them on demand.
state picked
expect state.render.boot_choice 1
expect state.render.preset Planetarium
expect state.render.full_sky_deferred true
expect state.render.full_sky_pipeline false
time set 2036-06-21T08:45:01Z
time pause
observer lat=37.77 lon=-122.42 agl=2
camera az=250 el=8 fov=70
wait settle
capture planetarium
preset Medium
wait 5
state medium
expect state.render.full_sky_deferred false
expect state.render.full_sky_pipeline true
wait settle
capture medium
preset Potato
wait settle
capture potato
